#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:143
#: 433b8ca047d04fc88df3370d08988c35
msgid "Compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:145
#: aa847dadd2af407c91702b847f239685
msgid "The ReaperF745v2 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:148
#: f432b83b32044ef3b5522e4b92cfcad4
msgid "Barometer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:150
#: 6e69d3d91e7a4813972becbd4dd00b6d
msgid "The ReaperF745v2 does not have a builtin barometer, but you can attach an external barometer using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads or use GPS as the EKF3 Z source. The board will boot without either, but only non altitude information requiring modes can be used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:153
#: 73f6e270223e4de8a229629a535b758d
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:155
#: 3dc74d4ab6e3457c9165d6aa8e5affb3
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:159
#: e815e180251b41cab0cbece931874a59
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""

